OL,3,GNEWSARescue launched as vessel in
OL,4,Adistress off Plymouth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vessel with five people on board is
OL,7,F"in distress" in the English Channel,
OL,8,Fthe coastguard has said.
OL,10,FA search and rescue helicopter and
OL,11,Fboats have been launched to try to help
OL,12,Fthe vessel south west of Eddystone
OL,13,FLighthouse off Plymouth, the Maritime
OL,14,Fand Coastguard Agency said.
OL,16,FIt said it was alerted just after 18:00
OL,17,FBST and a coastguard rescue helicopter
OL,18,Fand a fixed wing aircraft have been
OL,19,Fsent, together with RNLI lifeboats from
OL,20,FFalmouth and Plymouth.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
